# About

microdns is written by [Lucas DiCioccio](https://dicioccio.fr), who blogs at
[dicioccio.fr](https://dicioccio.fr). The code is on GitHub at
[`lucasdicioccio/microdns`](https://github.com/lucasdicioccio/microdns).

## This website

This website is generated with
[kitchen-sink](https://kitchensink-tech.github.io), a static-site generator
written in Haskell. The sources live in `website/src/` and the published
result in `docs/`, which GitHub Pages serves. To learn more about
kitchen-sink itself, see its
[website](https://kitchensink-tech.github.io) and its
[repository](https://github.com/kitchensink-tech/kitchensink).

## Elsewhere

- [**kitchen-sink**](https://kitchensink-tech.github.io): the generator
  behind this site.
- [**dicioccio.fr**](https://dicioccio.fr): the author's blog.

